    "the abstract indices to register, as a list of symbols", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"3698c0d9-cacb-42aa-9623-7442be5b0734"]},
   {"Name", 
    StyleBox["runtime", "TI"], Cell[TextData[{
     "a string; ",
