\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"67e6eced-d567-4024-b562-b3694795fd62"]},
   {"MetricInBasis", 
    StyleBox["option", "TI"], Cell["\<\
xAct option: component values of a metric in this chart or basis, given at \
