\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"5f26839b-3fcc-4860-b413-36f0516fd317"]},
   {"BasisChange", 
    StyleBox["option", "TI"], Cell["\<\
xAct option: the change-of-basis tensor from a previously defined basis\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6de0ca06-7c96-4733-adf2-9f6822d2af51"]},
   {"epsilonOrientationOfMetric", 
    StyleBox["option", "TI"], Cell["\<\
xAct option: {metric, sign} fixing the orientation factor between the \
